# What Vercel does not need in order to build and serve qubix.university.
#
# Without this file every tracked file goes up on every deploy. That was 64.8 MB
# against a 1.3 MB site, almost all of it current-app/, which the build never
# reads: nothing in vite.config.js, src/ or scripts/ references it. Uploading it
# is pure waste, it makes every deploy slow, and on a poor connection it is the
# difference between a deploy landing and timing out.
#
# Nothing here is deleted or untracked. It stays in Git, where it belongs, and
# simply stops being sent to a host that has no use for it.

# The consolidated application and creative work. Canonical in Git, not served.
current-app/

# Native shells. Built by Capacitor from dist/, never by Vercel.
android/
ios/

# Authoring and governance material. The Factory is dev-only and the curriculum
# records are not part of the site.
curriculum/
docs/
supabase/

# Local only.
.playwright-session/
*.log
